  "checked": "Best Ballon d'Or finishes from ballondor.com rankings (repo) + Wikipedia: Henry 2nd 2003, Buffon 2nd 2006, Iniesta 2nd 2010, Xavi 3rd 2009/10/11, Neuer 3rd 2014, Maldini best 3rd. 2010 FIFA Ballon d'Or shares Messi 22.65, Iniesta 17.36, Xavi 16.48 (Wikipedia, FC Barcelona, TopEndSports). World Cup winners Henry 1998, Buffon 2006, Xavi+Iniesta 2010, Neuer 2014; Maldini lost the 1994 final on penalties, Baggio missed the last kick (Wikipedia finals list, 1994 final). Henry did not play the 1998 final (Mail & Guardian, Capital FM). Iniesta 116', Fabregas pass, right side of the box, one touch, right-foot half-volley into the left corner (Wikipedia 2010 final). Undershirt 'Dani Jarque siempre con nosotros', booked for removing his shirt; Jarque died in August 2009 (Wikipedia Jarque, TimesLive). Kits: Spain all navy, Netherlands all orange (historicalkits, footballkitarchive). No one of the ten has won the Ballon d'Or up to 2026 (Kane won 2026).",
